---
// src/components/SignUp.astro
---

<section id="signup" class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Register Now</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">
                Register for yourself or your whole team now. Registration closes soon.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 w-2xl">
            
            <!-- Google Forms Embed -->
            <iframe 
                src="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScASb3TyHwFSD1TzQJR-EIpKjuliEnob1BA5exMAJdBpjRkQg/viewform?embedded=true"
                width="600"
                height="600"
                class="border-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 rounded-xl bg-gray-50">
                Loading…
            </iframe>
            <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center text-sm text-gray-500">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path>
                </svg>
                While Sam and SPAM may rhyme, one of them was awesome and one of them sucks.
                <br />
                <br />
                Your information is secure and will only be used for tournament updates.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>